  "_README": [
   "The gate ladder. Written 2026-08-04; before this, pipeline_debug read this file,",
   "failed to find it, defaulted to 'shadow', and nothing ever consumed the value.",
   "",
   "  shadow = measure + record, never surfaces as a blocker",
   "  warn   = measure + record + mark the run loudly, do not stop it",
   "  block  = measure + record + STOP the pipeline (raises QCBlocked)",
   "",
   "'mode' is the default for any REGISTERED gate that has no entry below.",
   "An UNREGISTERED gate is always shadow regardless of this value: a gate with",
   "no contract in qc_contract.GATE_CONTRACTS has not earned authority yet.",
   "That is what makes 'new gates enter at shadow' automatic.",
   "",
   "'enforce': false turns every block into a warn without touching per-gate",
   "modes. ZYG_QC_ENFORCE=0 does the same from the environment and wins over",
   "this file. That is the switch to pull during an incident.",
   "",
   "Promote a gate with:  python3 scripts/qc_gate_admin.py promote <gate>",
   "which REFUSES unless tests/golden passes for it."
  ],
